abstract: >-
  A theory-based module on curating geospatial research data so that it
  remains understandable and reusable: the curation lifecycle, metadata
  standards, documentation, digital preservation, sharing and publishing in
  repositories with DOIs and licenses, the FAIR and CARE principles, and the
  ethics of sensitive location data.
